    "description": "The agreed model is ONE ASSIGNMENT RECORD PER REP PER DEAL, PERMANENTLY — pause, resume and reassignment all update the same record. There is currently no validation rule or trigger enforcing it.\n\nEvidence it matters: migration profiling found three Rebet-CTM rep/deal pairs each with two simultaneously active assignments on the same NXTLVL link, because earlier rows were never closed when replacement rows were created (migration item C4).\n\n* Validation rule or trigger preventing a second Active assignment for the same rep + deal\n\n* MUST NOT block migration loads — bypass via custom permission or Assignment_Source__c = Migration\n\n* Error message points the user at the existing record rather than just refusing\n\nEffort: \\~3h. Ready to build.\n\nSource: Asana Reconciliation v2, 2026-07-29, §5; CMS Integration Design v1 §5.3 rule 1 and §9 item C4.",
